    name: `Rajdhani Sweets & Restaurant`,
    tagline: `“Love at First Bite” is the official tagline of Rajdhani Sweets & Restaurant, a .`,
    description: `“Love at First Bite” is the official tagline of Rajdhani Sweets & Restaurant, a fast-casual dining franchise specializing in authentic Indian cuisine and sweets. Since their start in 2002, Rajdhani’s `,
