    id: `sourced-fitd-by-metronicity-inc`,
    name: `FITd by Metronicity, Inc.`,
    tagline: `FITd is an automated staffing business designed to create positive socioeconomic.`,
    description: `FITd is an automated staffing business designed to create positive socioeconomic impact. FITd sets up the next generation workers and workplaces for success. We help make lives better for all in local`,
    longDescription: `FITd is an automated staffing business designed to create positive socioeconomic impact. FITd sets up the next generation workers and workplaces for success. We help make lives better for all in local communities. Employment is a lucrative relationships business. FITd is a culmination of lessons in applying technology with human factors earned and learned from 55 years of corporate, entrepreneurship, university, college, and immigration work in Canada and North America. Automation for business owners means more profit, less cost, less work, and faster development. In fact, a FITd franchise can operate on a full Auto-Pilot Mode; meaning buy it and just watch it grow. You can also operate on a Maximum Autonomy Mode for maximum participation and control or you arrange something in between. FITd lets you own a piece of technology that will only appreciate in value over time. Franchising FITd is like buying a job instead of applying for it. You’ll never be alone in making great impact. It is a business that you can also work on to further increase its value then sell  for a higher amount or leave behind for your next generations. Please complete the fields below to contact us (* indicates a required field).`,
