    longDescription: `Restore Canada is a proudly Canadian-owned and operated property restoration company specializing in full-circle service for residential, commercial, and industrial clients. Our mission is simple: to give Canadians a building they feel safe and comfortable in, by representing the property owner, not the insurance company. Unlike traditional restoration franchises that prioritize insurance contracts and preferred vendor status, Restore Canada stands firmly on the side of the homeowner. We’re redefining what it means to be in the restoration business by putting people first, responding faster, and staying with our clients from the moment of crisis through to full rebuild. Canadian-Founded, Canadian-Grown – No U.S. headquarters or foreign interests. We’re built for the unique climate, housing, and customer needs of Ontario and beyond. Full-Circle Model – From emergency response to full rebuild, all under one roof. Client-Focused – We represent the homeowner, not the insurer. Our techs advocate for proper drying, documentation, and rebuild quality.`,
